    "Cost": 1546976,
    "UIName": "Tian-zong",
    "Id": "chassisdef_tian-zong_TNZ-N3",
    "Name": "Tian-zong",
    "Details": "This variant is based on the N1. It uses the same Gauss Rifles, but they only have a ton of ammunition. Two heat sinks have been removed (leaving ten in the engine) as have the ER Medium Lasers. The freed space and mass allows the N3 to carry a Light PPC in each arm. It is identical to the N1 in all other respects.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Well Balanced</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.11</color></b>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_tianzong"
  },
  "VariantName": "TNZ-N3",
  "ChassisTags": {
    "items": [
